 "dialogue": [
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "There is a car race near our town every year.",
   "zh": "在我们镇子附近每年都有一场汽车比赛。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L069.mp4",
    "start": 7,
    "end": 11.9
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "In 1995, there was a very big race.",
   "zh": "1995 年举行了一次盛大的比赛。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L069.mp4",
    "start": 11.9,
    "end": 17.6
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "There were hundreds of people there.",
   "zh": "许许多多的人都去了赛场。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L069.mp4",
    "start": 17.6,
    "end": 20.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "My wife and I were at the race.",
   "zh": "我和我的妻子也去了。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L069.mp4",
    "start": 20.8,
    "end": 24.3
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Our friends Julie and Jack were there, too.",
   "zh": "我们的朋友朱莉和杰克也去了。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L069.mp4",
    "start": 24.3,
    "end": 29
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "You can see us in the crowd.",
   "zh": "你可以在人群中看到我们。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L069.mp4",
    "start": 29,
    "end": 31.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "We are standing on the left.",
   "zh": "我们站在左面。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L069.mp4",
    "start": 31.7,
    "end": 35.6
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "There were twenty cars in the race.",
   "zh": "参加比赛的有 20 辆汽车。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L069.mp4",
    "start": 35.6,
    "end": 39.1
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "There were English cars, French cars, German cars, Italian cars, American cars and Japanese cars.",
   "zh": "有英国、法国、德国、意大利、美国和日本的汽车。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L069.mp4",
    "start": 39.1,
    "end": 51
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "It was an exciting finish.",
   "zh": "比赛的结尾是激动人心的。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L069.mp4",
    "start": 51,
    "end": 54.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "The winner was Billy Stewart.",
   "zh": "获胜者是比利·斯图尔特。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L069.mp4",
    "start": 54.2,
    "end": 57.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "He was in car number fifteen.",
   "zh": "他在第 15 号车里，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L069.mp4",
    "start": 57.4,
    "end": 60.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Five other cars were just behind him.",
   "zh": "其他 5 辆汽车紧跟在他后面。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L069.mp4",
    "start": 60.8,
    "end": 65.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "On the way home, my wife said to me,",
   "zh": "在回家的途中，我妻子对我说：",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L069.mp4",
    "start": 65.2,
    "end": 69.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "'Don't drive so quickly!",
   "zh": "“别开得这样快！",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L069.mp4",
    "start": 69.7,
    "end": 72.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "You're not Billy Stewart!'",
   "zh": "你可不是比利·斯图尔特！”",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L069.mp4",
    "start": 72.2,
    "end": 74.9
   }
  }
 ],
